<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>For you lazy player spamming their F, just hold the F button

Instruction : 
- Bind on F (recommended)
- Operation mode &gt; run while key pressed

Note : only one macro works at the times, e.g. : You can't use F spam button while Bhop macro, the bhop macro will stopped

Feel free to download and gave feedback/idea for a new macro</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
